{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine and powered by state-of-the-art rendering technologies, REDACT delivers a gritty, immersive tactical shooter experience that blurs the line between video games and reality \u2014 giving players the most authentic and realistic experience possible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.poster.avif?t=1757071714\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.webm?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.mp4?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDACT is a hyper-realistic bodycam first-person shooter where players take on the role of an elite operator completing high-risk tactical missions. With immersive audio, limited HUD, realistic gunplay, and a grounded single-player and multiplayer experience, the game challenges players to use real-world tactics, make split-second decisions, and survive intense urban combat scenarios.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.poster.avif?t=1757071714\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.webm?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.mp4?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>CORE FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-Aiming System with No Crosshair</strong><br>Master a raw aiming system that offers no aim assist, no crosshair \u2014 just your skill, your weapon, and pure focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist and Tactical Gunplay</strong><br>No arcade chaos \u2014 every bullet counts. Execute your plans with caution in a \u201cdie and retry\u201d structure that punishes carelessness and rewards precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Multiplayer Missions</strong><br>Play intense solo operations or join forces in cooperative tactical missions where coordination is key and failure is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodycam-Style Immersion</strong><br>Experience the game through a body-mounted camera with realistic head and weapon movement, aggressive motion effects, and zero UI distractions \u2014 as close to real footage as it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built in Unreal Engine Using Modern Tech</strong><br>Designed with the latest features of Unreal Engine to deliver photorealistic visuals, immersive audio, and responsive gameplay for the most grounded experience possible.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3816490?t=1757071714","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/1c0155bbe08e481a19cebb477a8e6c74f942026e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757071714","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/4a8b13eaea95250eea7c998cd4bc9956e59173b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757071714","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/4a8b13eaea95250eea7c998cd4bc9956e59173b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757071714","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Developed with Unreal Engine and powered by state-of-the-art rendering technologies, REDACT delivers a gritty, immersive tactical shooter experience that blurs the line between video games and reality \u2014 giving players the most authentic and realistic experience possible.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.poster.avif?t=1757071714\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.webm?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/8e64f82eff258407feec158149ab94d9.mp4?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>REDACT is a hyper-realistic bodycam first-person shooter where players take on the role of an elite operator completing high-risk tactical missions. With immersive audio, limited HUD, realistic gunplay, and a grounded single-player and multiplayer experience, the game challenges players to use real-world tactics, make split-second decisions, and survive intense urban combat scenarios.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.poster.avif?t=1757071714\" width=800 height=452 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.webm?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/extras/c474b26e3b98a4e04e47f730dbe1c91e.mp4?t=1757071714\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>CORE FEATURES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free-Aiming System with No Crosshair</strong><br>Master a raw aiming system that offers no aim assist, no crosshair \u2014 just your skill, your weapon, and pure focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Minimalist and Tactical Gunplay</strong><br>No arcade chaos \u2014 every bullet counts. Execute your plans with caution in a \u201cdie and retry\u201d structure that punishes carelessness and rewards precision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single-Player and Multiplayer Missions</strong><br>Play intense solo operations or join forces in cooperative tactical missions where coordination is key and failure is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bodycam-Style Immersion</strong><br>Experience the game through a body-mounted camera with realistic head and weapon movement, aggressive motion effects, and zero UI distractions \u2014 as close to real footage as it gets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Built in Unreal Engine Using Modern Tech</strong><br>Designed with the latest features of Unreal Engine to deliver photorealistic visuals, immersive audio, and responsive gameplay for the most grounded experience possible.</p>","developers":["Dispatch Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3816490/64872fbf59f31ec3ba6c5510c9282d403d5c212a/header.jpg?t=1757071714","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"